===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{senseid|en|interactive seminar conducted via Internet}} An interactive [[seminar]] conducted via [[Internet]]. Usually a live presentation, lecture or workshop that happens in real time, as users participate through text-based chat, voice, video, or file-sharing.
#: {{uxi|en|I just got an email invitation to a '''webinar''' on the value of primary sources.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2002|author=Ann Rockley|title=Managing Enterprise Content|page=274|pageurl=http://print.google.com/print?id=61WSVFLVVn8C&pg=PA274&lpg=PA274&sig=srg1AwSMEcWWtFSXInCxYDFXaMo|passage=Web conferences or '''Webinars''' are a great way to learn about products or subjects of interest.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2003|author=Francoise Tourniaire|title=Just Enough CRM|page=168|pageurl=http://print.google.com/print?id=hjgcsD02yjUC&pg=PA168&lpg=PA168&sig=BpRLdepR6kOg5bs90hH9qiV5dVY|passage='''Webinars''' are often painfully short on exposure to the actual product, devoting half of the typical one-hour length to an “expert” disserting on some lofty topic, another fifteen minutes to a fluffy presentation about the company and its strategic direction, and a scant five minutes to a quick demo.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2003|title=Andrea Learned|quoted_in=Martha Barletta's ''Marketing to Women''|page=93|pageurl=http://print.google.com/print?id=hQKnE5aIu5IC&pg=PA93&lpg=PA93&sig=0Xj5El2z1UkcFVD8xg5WN74mMZQ|passage=It's not that all women aren't interested in learning to download files or take '''Webinars''', it's that their “why bother” factor may well kick in.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2006|title=Selling Power|volume=26|issue=1{{ndash}}9|page=44|passage=Register today for our informative '''webinar''' and executive book offer.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2011|author=Jon Wuebben|title=Content is Currency: Developing Powerful Content for Web and Mobile|page=28|passage=One other point: An impressive site design can never rescue poorly written copy, sloppy videos, or boring '''webinar''' recordings.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2013|author=Kristin Kipp|title=Teaching on the Education Frontier|page=82|passage=Although there are many other tools that are available in a '''webinar''' tool, these are the ones you'll find yourself using most often.}}

